Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:06:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/57] Click an unsaved change bar to compare with saved

A left click on an orange change history bar or an unsaved deletion tick
opens Compare with saved for the tab, without moving the cursor. The
pointer becomes a hand over a clickable mark. Saved (green) marks and the
rest of the gutter keep their behaviour.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

